{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14796","headline":"和考功王员外杪秋忆终南旧居 · 卢纶","name":"和考功王员外杪秋忆终南旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静忆溪边宅，知君许谢公。\n晓霜凝耒耜，初日照梧桐。\n涧鼠喧藤蔓，山禽窜石藂。\n白云当岭雨，黄叶遶堦风。\n野果垂桥上，高泉落水中。\n欢荣来自间，羸贱赏曾同。\n月满珠藏海，天晴鹤在笼。\n余阴如可寄，愿得隐墙东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}